Nabla_Text_StevenSootopolisCall:
	.string "STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}! There you are.\n"
	.string "Congratulations on your eighth BADGE!\p"
	.string "But listen, I came because it's\n"
	.string "urgent.\p"
	.string "A POKéMON with emerald scales was\n"
	.string "seen on a lost island east of\l"
	.string "PACIFIDLOG TOWN.\p"
	.string "It looked weakened… If it's the one\n"
	.string "I think it is, we have to hurry.\p"
	.string "There's a tall pillar on that island.\n"
	.string "Meet me at the very top!$"

Nabla_Text_VictoryRoadBlocked:
	.string "STEVEN is waiting at the top of the\n"
	.string "pillar east of PACIFIDLOG TOWN.\p"
	.string "It sounded urgent…\n"
	.string "VICTORY ROAD will have to wait.$"

Nabla_Text_StevenYouMadeIt:
	.string "STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}! You made it.\p"
	.string "Look… up there!$"

Nabla_Text_StevenRayquazaIsExhausted:
	.string "STEVEN: RAYQUAZA…\p"
	.string "Calming GROUDON and KYOGRE must have\n"
	.string "drained all of its strength.\p"
	.string "It can barely fly…$"

Nabla_Text_MeteoriteIsGlowing:
	.string "Huh?\n"
	.string "Something in your BAG is glowing…\p"
	.string "It's the METEORITE!$"

Nabla_Text_RayquazaAteMeteorite:
	.string "RAYQUAZA swallowed the METEORITE!$"

Nabla_Text_StevenRayquazaTestsYou:
	.string "STEVEN: Its strength is back…\n"
	.string "No, it's even stronger than before!\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}{KUN}, it's staring right at you.\n"
	.string "It wants to test you!$"

Nabla_Text_RayquazaWantsToBattleAgain:
	.string "RAYQUAZA is still glaring at you…\p"
	.string "It wants to battle again!$"

Nabla_Text_RayquazaWantsToStayWithYou:
	.string "RAYQUAZA wants to stay by your side!\p"
	.string "Your party is full. Choose a POKéMON\n"
	.string "to send to the PC.$"

Nabla_Text_MonWentToPC:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} was sent to the PC.$"

Nabla_Text_StevenRayquazaChoseYou:
	.string "STEVEN: Incredible…\n"
	.string "RAYQUAZA chose you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
	.string "The METEORITE awakened a move in it:\n"
	.string "DRAGON ASCENT.\p"
	.string "With this move, RAYQUAZA can MEGA\n"
	.string "EVOLVE without a MEGA STONE.\l"
	.string "Your MEGA BRACELET is all it needs.$"

Nabla_Text_StevenSomethingIsComing:
	.string "STEVEN: …Wait.\n"
	.string "Something is coming from the sky!$"

Nabla_Text_StevenDeoxysFollowedMeteorite:
	.string "STEVEN: That POKéMON…\p"
	.string "It must have followed the METEORITE\n"
	.string "all the way from space!$"

Nabla_Text_StevenVictoryRoadAwaits:
	.string "STEVEN: What a day…\p"
	.string "Thank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}. Without you,\n"
	.string "RAYQUAZA wouldn't have made it.\p"
	.string "Now the POKéMON LEAGUE is waiting.\n"
	.string "VICTORY ROAD starts in EVER GRANDE\l"
	.string "CITY.\p"
	.string "I'll be cheering for you!$"

Nabla_Text_CozmoKeepTheMeteorite:
	.string "PROF. COZMO: …No. On second thought,\n"
	.string "I can't take it from you.\p"
	.string "You stood up to TEAM MAGMA and\n"
	.string "brought it back. That's more than\l"
	.string "enough for me.\p"
	.string "Keep the METEORITE. I have a feeling\n"
	.string "it has a part to play by your side.\p"
	.string "But please, take this TM anyway.\n"
	.string "It's a gift, for all your help!$"

Nabla_Text_CozmoTakeCareOfMeteorite:
	.string "PROF. COZMO: Take good care of that\n"
	.string "METEORITE. I just know it's meant to\l"
	.string "be with you!$"

Nabla_Text_WhiteRockReacts:
	.string "It's a white rock.\p"
	.string "…It seems to be reacting to one of\n"
	.string "your POKéMON!\p"
	.string "Bring a POKéMON close to the rock?$"

Nabla_Text_WhiteRockFormChanged:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} touched the white rock…\p"
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} changed its FORME!$"

Nabla_Text_WhiteRockNothingHappened:
	.string "Nothing happened…$"
